Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run, until we reach{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until we reach you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clear blue open sea{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A sliver of a miracle{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've encountered more\NThan we could ever imagine{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With every step we take on this journey{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The goal is still out of sight{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we can overcome anything{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just to see your smile{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we wavered, we couldn't shine{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We even strove to conquer our weaknesses{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We, who were truly devoted{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have always been the same{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until we reach\NUntil we reach you, hey{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Less than legendary?\NNo problem! It's all good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until the day we can laugh\NFollow the shining map{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, no more hesitation, fighter\NIt's gonna be alright{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to leave,\Nbut it's time to get out of the Block Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope that it's Elbaph outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...Kong Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"An Encounter on a Snowfield -\NLoki, the Accursed Prince"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't find hide nor hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We've searched all the nearby waters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...they sank into the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's search the sea floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Pirate Crew! Dive into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Elbaph warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The search is called off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and the others are still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we searched and searched,\Nbut they were nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the Sunny isn't some flimsy ship\Nthat would sink that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alive for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time\Nwe've gotten separated like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to make sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Bosses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we were worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:05:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've tapped into my shark network,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems there's no sign of\NLuffy and the others in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's a possibility\Nthey've washed ashore on some island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've all done more than enough already,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and the food supplies on this ship\Nhave run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It defeats the purpose\Nif you all starve to death trying to find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for searching for them\Nas if they were your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all heading for the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If their own crew says so, they're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for them at Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Head for Elbaph!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to our homecoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, we have no more booze or food left!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're outside, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like it chose to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i},\Nyou can have my cloak if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sanji-{\i1}kun{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid\Nyou couldn't catch a cold if you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that, you third-rate swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's massive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this tree?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this just another block creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...how many thousands of years old it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All the trees are like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's huge! Is that a mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the size of an island...\NNo, even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's so vast,\Nit's making me dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unreal...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This suspension bridge is insanely long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it go all the way up, past the clouds?\NI can't see the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But behind us is the Sun God's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to go but forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way! It's a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, follow me then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming across the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why on earth did Hajrudin bring\Na weirdo like that into the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because\Nhe's a skilled navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Shame of Elbaph, not Loki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that,\Nit'll only make Rodo happy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Piper, you saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw his crow carrying a small ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruders should be arrested, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but Rodo tends to invite them in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His hobbies are really quite a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch him red-handed\Nand report him to Chief Jarul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just let them pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did you hear that, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They said Elbaph. So this must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But they look like nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Look over...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!\NThey said intruders would be arrested!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to Nami-{\i1}san{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there would be\Na beautiful Giant lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rodo, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's swinging!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This Giant-sized suspension bridge\Nis full of gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to walk on tightropes all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm good at this sort of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see some unusually large flakes of snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry. If the Giants show up,\Nthere'll be nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trial! A trial for the brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest below is full of giant wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A tingly feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting\Nthis directionally-challenged mosshead go, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be allowed in any forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's who roared\Nwhen we were in the Block Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crawling with wolves down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Be brave, Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Be brave, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...raided Egghead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's in today's newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they lie like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too small. I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll read it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"After a 100-year slumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the Giant Pirate Crew returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with Straw Hat Luffy, an Emperor of the Sea,\Nthey plunged Egghead into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The captains of the Giant Pirate Crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brogy the Red Ogre
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and Dorry the Blue Ogre,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,have bounties of 1.8 billion berries each."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,1.8 billion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They put new bounties on your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recall "returning" to anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The bosses' bounties used to be\N100 million each.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They have skyrocketed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Prices are completely different\Nfrom 100 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fair bounty\Nfor the captains of Elbaph warriors now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Prices...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prices are different, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And it says our captain murdered Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They twisted the story as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He murdered me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. He was trying to protect you\Nuntil the very end, wasn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...when this picture was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably at some point\Nduring our time on Egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,WEJ lackeys are everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and anyone's photos can fetch a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy turns into his free form,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,does a mark like this\Nalways appear on his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can definitely see\Nsomething like a mark there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he have that?\NHe moves around so much, I never looked closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems unnatural to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His arm is blurry, but the mark is sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a strange thing to fixate on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It just seems familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, to think that Straw Hat\Nis now on par with Red Hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a young one named Hajrudin\Nfrom Elbaph became his subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hajrudin! He's technically the king's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the king of Elbaph?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to be a violent little brat\Nwhen he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted to come along to pick you up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there was a bit of trouble in Elbaph.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why only us veterans came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This happened while Bosses were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The king had another child,\Nthis time a legitimate one.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Toy blocks were fun,\Nbut this is how an adventure should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.41,0:17:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever roared has such a loud voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be awesome\Nif he gave me a big chunk of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you all want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was from...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That new child...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That new child is known as the Accursed Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Accursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He committed every kind of evil deed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so he has been chained up for several years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but he nearly escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...until the entire troop of warriors\Nswarmed and seized him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire troop of Elbaph Giants?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he is out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Driven by a lust for the Legendary Devil Fruit\Npassed down through the Elbaph royalty,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he murdered his own father, the king,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and ate the fruit.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would his name happen to be...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets loose again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the world will fall apart.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the Shame of Elbaph!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Accursed Prince...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.01,0:19:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Loki!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Name yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who'll be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,King?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You came here not knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense. If you knew where you were,\Nyou wouldn't have come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.11,0:20:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the kingdom of Elbaph warriors...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,War-Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The nation that once devoted itself\Nto endless conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest country of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...I am the one\Nwho will bring about the world's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Sun God...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...Loki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here I am straining both my eyes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And checking where I am standing right now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With my brain consumed\NBy all the delusion and despair{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm always bound to be a little off somehow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The things that come up vividly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are always the cruel memories{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gather up the scraps\NOf the simple boredom of my life{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might turn into somebody else but me{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder which future\NWould fit someone like me now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From here on\NNo matter how hard I try to strain my eyes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll still see nothing anyhow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm riding the headwind{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I pour it into the tear of destiny{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I split all the false fantasies apart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And everyone's{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Piling up their own life-or-death reality\NAll the time just like that{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then tomorrow comes way too loud{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.36,0:22:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leaving no time even just to pray{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that future we see{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It all belongs to me{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.38,0:23:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luffy encounters Loki, the Accursed Prince,\Nperpetrator of a crime that rocked Elbaph.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Loki claims to have information\Nabout Red-Haired Shanks and offers Luffy a deal.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What will Loki's true intentions\Nbring about?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of ONE PIECE!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"A Dangerous Deal!\NLoki of the Underworld and Luffy"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:15.01,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kakero todoku made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:19.35,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kimi ni todoku made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.61,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}aoku sunda unabara{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.94,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kiseki no kakera{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:37.24,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kazoekirenai hodo deaeta ne{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:40.41,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}susumu tabi susumu tabi{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:44.25,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}goru wa mada mienai mama{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.79,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}demo nandatte koerareru yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.21,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sono egao mitai kara{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.43,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mayoeba hikari ni nareya shinakatta{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:59.01,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yowasa mo chanto tagayashita{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:04.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hontou honki de ita bokura mada{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:08.52,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kawaranai yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:09.65,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kakero{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:17.20,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}todoku made kimi ni todoku made nee{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:23.87,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}densetsu miman datte joutou joutou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:30.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kirameku chizu itsuka waraeru hi made{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:36.55,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mou mayoi wa nainda Fighter daijoubu{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.85,On Top,,0,0,0,,GERD, SHIP DOCTOR, NEW GIANT WARRIOR PIRATES
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.61,On Top,,0,0,0,,GOLDBERG, COOK, NEW GIANT WARRIOR PIRATES
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.83,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kenmei ni me wo korashite{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:43.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}genzaichi wo tashikameteiru{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:49.35,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mousou to zetsubou ni nareta noumiso dewa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:52.64,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}doushitatte chotto zurechimau ya{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:57.06,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}senmei ni ukandekuru no wa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:02.11,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}itsudatte hidoi omoide de{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:08.24,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kantan na taikutsu wo hiroiatsumete wa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:11.83,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dareka mitai ni nacchimaisou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:16.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ore ni niau mirai wa doredarou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:20.42,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}koko kara jaa ikura me wo korashitemo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:22.88,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nanimo mie wa shinai sa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:26.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}gyakufuu ni nokkatte{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:29.22,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}machigatta kuusou wo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:33.68,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kirisaita unmei no sakeme ni nagashikomu{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:37.23,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}daremo ga sou yatte{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:41.77,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}inochigake no genjitsu wo kasaneteirunda{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.36,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}negau hima mo nai hodo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.36,0:22:48.90,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sawagashii ashita ga kuru{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:53.74,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}sono mirai wa hora{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:57.91,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ore no mon da yo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

